# OpenAI API Configuration
# To enable AI-powered custom topic generation:
# 1. Get your API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 2. Copy this file to .env
# 3. Replace the placeholder with your actual API key

VITE_AI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Optional: Database configuration for leaderboards
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/mmmunchers